

Version Logic: useMemo hook to ensure the signature always pulls the current two-digit year, month, and day from the system clock.
 Version should be YY.MM.DD-B, B is the build version for the day. Not the run version. Whenever there is a code change, in any file,
  update the Version in about section of the application.

General: For working specs or logic, Do not change any file without letting me know.

Grid Size :  3 X 3 (default), 4 x 4, 5 X 5